{"3585880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Faroda", "steam_appid": 3585880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faroda</strong> is a challenging <strong>2D platformer</strong> with colorful <strong>pixel-art</strong> graphics and <strong>chiptune</strong> soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the 5 islands of a remote archipelago, completing over <strong>100 levels</strong>, collecting treasure chests and many <strong>hidden gems</strong> along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to help Faroda, the protagonist of this adventure, gather the immense wealth scattered across these islands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly: will you be able to find the <strong>legendary artifact</strong>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 levels</strong> to complete the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High difficulty, but never frustrating, thanks to <strong>instant load times</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>keyboard</strong> and <strong>gamepad</strong> support (gamepad is recommended).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>tutorial</strong> that teaches you all the gameplay mechanics to get started.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of <strong>collectible gems</strong> to find.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many <strong>hidden passages</strong> to discover.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful <strong>pixel art</strong> graphics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>chiptune</strong> soundtrack.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>, including a <strong>secret ending</strong> for completionists.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faroda</strong> is a challenging <strong>2D platformer</strong> with colorful <strong>pixel-art</strong> graphics and <strong>chiptune</strong> soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the 5 islands of a remote archipelago, completing over <strong>100 levels</strong>, collecting treasure chests and many <strong>hidden gems</strong> along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to help Faroda, the protagonist of this adventure, gather the immense wealth scattered across these islands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly: will you be able to find the <strong>legendary artifact</strong>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 levels</strong> to complete the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High difficulty, but never frustrating, thanks to <strong>instant load times</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>keyboard</strong> and <strong>gamepad</strong> support (gamepad is recommended).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>tutorial</strong> that teaches you all the gameplay mechanics to get started.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of <strong>collectible gems</strong> to find.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many <strong>hidden passages</strong> to discover.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful <strong>pixel art</strong> graphics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>chiptune</strong> soundtrack.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>, including a <strong>secret ending</strong> for completionists.</p></l